{
    "title": "TransUnion: Credit Monitoring",
    "description": "Our TransUnion Credit Monitoring App lets you check your credit report anytime, anywhere!\r\n\r\nChecking your Score does not hurt your credit; instead, you can enjoy tips and best practices to achieve your desired credit score. You can do all these activities conveniently from your phone:\r\n\r\n1. See what's helping or hurting your VantageScore \u00ae\u00a0 3.0 from TransUnion, Equifax, and Experian.\r\n\r\n2. Rest easy with $1,000,000 Identity Theft Insurance.\r\n\r\n3. Monitor your TransUnion credit file with Instant Inquiry Alerts for hard inquiries.\r\n\r\n4. Enable push notifications and get updates directly on your phone about score changes, stolen cards, collections, new authorized users and trades, and critical account activity that impacts your credit report.\r\n\r\n5. Check your VantageScore \u00ae 3.0 daily from TransUnion.\r\n\r\nJoin more than 12 million consumers who have used TransUnion Credit Monitoring. Download the app today!\r\n \r\nABOUT TRANSUNION\r\nTransUnion is a global information and insights company with over 13,000 associates operating in more than 30 countries. We make trust possible by ensuring each person is reliably represented in the marketplace. We do this with a Tru\u2122 picture of each person: an actionable view of consumers, stewarded with care. Through our acquisitions and technology investments we have developed innovative solutions that extend beyond our strong foundation in core credit into areas such as marketing, fraud, risk and advanced analytics. As a result, consumers and businesses can transact with confidence and achieve great things. We call this Information for Good\u00ae \u2014 and it leads to economic opportunity, great experiences and personal empowerment for millions of people around the world.\u00a0http://www.transunion.com/business\r\n\r\nPersonal information we collect -- https://www.transunion.com/privacy/consumer-interactive#2\r\nDo not sell or share my personal information -- https://www.transunion.com/optout\r\nLimit the use of my sensitive personal information -- https://www.transunion.com/optout",
